OL,3,GNEWSAHow computer game Worms went from
OL,4,Aclassroom to classic
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Davidson was 22 when the game he
OL,7,Fprogrammed, partly in his last years at
OL,8,FBournemouth School, first hit the
OL,9,Fshelves.
OL,11,FThirty-one years later, the various
OL,12,Fincarnations of Worms have sold enough
OL,13,Fcopies that everyone in the UK could
OL,14,Fhave one.
OL,16,FDavidson said: "Across all formats and
OL,17,Fall versions of the game it's up to 70
OL,18,Fmillion now. I just can't get my head
OL,19,Faround it."
