OL,4,Aclassroom to classic
OL,5,
OL,6,FWorms is a turn-based artillery game
OL,7,Fwhere players control a team of
OL,8,Finvertebrates who use a variety of
OL,9,Fcreative ways to destroy their
OL,10,Fopponents.
